        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Breastfeeding is not recommended with maternal lithium use; however, if a woman chooses to breastfeed, the infant should be closely monitored for signs of lithium toxicity.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-lithium",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
